MPLETED · M2 COMPLETED · M3 COMPLETED · M4 COMPLETED · M5 COMPLETED</div>\n<h1 class=\"hero\">运动达人</h1><p>你说想练什么，或者给一张动作照片。系统把需求、动作识别、关节结果和完整人体解剖放在同一个页面里。</p><div class=\"intent\"><input id=\"wish\" aria-label=\"我要练\" placeholder=\"例如：户外有单杠，想练背和手臂；或 15 分钟在家练全身\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"runWish\">给方案</button></div><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip preset\" data-v=\"户外有单杠，想练背和手臂\">户外单杠</button><button class=\"chip preset\" data-v=\"15分钟在家练全身\">15分钟全身</button><button class=\"chip preset\" data-v=\"想练右手臂和二头肌\">右手臂</button></div><div id=\"wishResult\" class=\"result plan\">先输入一句“我要练……”。</div></section><div class=\"grid\"><section class=\"card\"><h2>动作识别｜真实照片 → 关节</h2><p>上传动作照片后，直接识别 33 个身体关键点，把骨架画回原图，并计算肘、髋、膝角度。</p><label class=\"upload\">选择动作照片<input class=\"hiddenInput\" id=\"poseFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\"></label><button class=\"chip\" id=\"poseSample\" type=\"button\" disabled>运行真实俯卧撑样本</button><div id=\"poseStatus\" class=\"status\">正在准备姿态模型…</div><div id=\"poseStage\" class=\"poseStage\"><img id=\"poseImg\" alt=\"用户动作照片\"><canvas id=\"poseCanvas\"></canvas></div><div id=\"poseResult\" class=\"result plan\">等待照片。</div><div id=\"jointMap\" class=\"jointgrid\"></div><p class=\"status\">识别上游：MediaPipe Pose Landmarker Full。完整保留单图路径的 33 个二维关键点、33 个三维世界关键点、骨架连接、置信度与分割掩码；关节角度用于动作观察，不替代医疗诊断，也不冒充 OpenSim 生物力学结果。</p></section><section class=\"card\"><h2>同一人体坐标系</h2><p>照片关键点会映射到标准身体关节 ID；识别出的关节在这里形成统一结果，后续 OpenSim 与训练反馈复用同一组 ID。</p><div id=\"coordResult\" class=\"plan\">尚未收到动作照片。</div><h3>动作反馈</h3><div id=\"motionFeedback\" class=\"plan\">上传照片后生成基于关节角度的可检验描述，不凭照片猜伤病。</div><h3>当前验收边界</h3>\n<div class=\"gate ok\"><b>M3 COMPLETED｜2026-10-04。</b><br>真实图片已在本主页面完成 MediaPipe Pose Landmarker Full 推理：33 个二维关键点、33 个世界坐标关键点、分割掩膜与 6 个标准关节结果均回写统一人体坐标；自然语言路径同时通过。<a href=\"../docs/v0.1/M3-completion-report-2026-10-04.md\">完成报告</a> · <a href=\"../docs/v0.1/evidence/m3/public-pose-verification.json\">公开验收证据</a>。</div>\n</section></div>\n<section class=\"card\" id=\"m4-biomechanics\"><div class=\"status\">M4｜COMPLETED｜2026-10-04｜真实 OpenSim Core 计算链</div><h2>真实肌骨 / 生物力学｜OpenSim Arm26</h2><p>不是读取 XML 或播放网页动画：以下数值由 OpenSim Core 4.6 实际加载成熟 Arm26 模型，设置 <code>r_elbow_flex</code> 坐标状态后，在 Position 阶段逐状态计算。</p><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"0\" disabled>肘屈 0°</button><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"30\" disabled>30°</button><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"60\" disabled>60°</button><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"90\" disabled>90°</button><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"120\" disabled>120°</button></div><p id=\"m4Status\" class=\"status\">正在读取 OpenSim Core 可复现计算产物…</p><div id=\"m4Result\" class=\"plan\">等待真实计算结果。</div><p id=\"m4Source\" class=\"status\">来源与单位将在产物校验后显示。</p><p class=\"status\">输出为模型状态相关的 muscle-tendon length 与 elbow moment arm；用于可复现的模型观察，不等同于个人医学诊断、实测肌力或训练处方。<a href=\"../docs/v0.1/M4-completion-report-2026-10-04.md\">M4 完成报告</a> · <a href=\"../docs/v0.1/evidence/m4/public-opensim-verification.json\">公开验收证据</a>。</p></section>\n<section class=\"card\" id=\"biceps-dynamic-3d\"><div class=\"status\">SUB｜COMMON-HUMAN-COORDINATE / HUMAN-3D｜BICEPS-DYNAMIC-3D-V0.8</div><h2>同一真实右上肢 3D｜屈伸、前臂运动与肌肉形态</h2><p>右肩胛骨、肱骨、桡骨、尺骨、肱二头肌长头/短头共用一个 WebGL 视窗。桡尺骨作为同一刚性前臂组绕组内肘 pivot 屈伸；当前 CENTERED_LOCAL_WRAPPER 只能证明功能响应，尚不能证明肌肉近端/远端附着连续。</p><div id=\"realUpper3d\" style=\"height:520px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#edf0ec;position:relative\"><div style=\"padding:14px\">正在加载 BodyParts3D 右上肢…</div></div><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip phasePreset\" data-phase=\"伸展\" data-elbow=\"0\" data-twist=\"0\">伸展</button><button class=\"chip phasePreset\" data-phase=\"屈曲中段\" data-elbow=\"60\" data-twist=\"30\">屈曲中段</button><button class=\"chip phasePreset\" data-phase=\"屈肘峰值\" data-elbow=\"120\" data-twist=\"55\">屈肘峰值</button><label class=\"chip\">屈肘 <input id=\"realElbowRange\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"120\" value=\"0\"></label><output id=\"realElbowOut\">0°</output><label class=\"chip\">前臂 <input id=\"realForearmRange\" type=\"range\" min=\"-80\" max=\"80\" value=\"0\"></label><output id=\"realForearmOut\">0°</output></div><div class=\"chips\"><label class=\"chip\">拖动观察角度 <input id=\"armViewRange\" type=\"range\" min=\"-60\" max=\"60\" value=\"0\" step=\"5\"></label><output id=\"armViewOut\">正面 0°</output><button class=\"chip\" id=\"bicepsReset\">回到伸展</button><span id=\"phaseName\" class=\"status\">阶段：伸展</span></div><p id=\"realAssetState\" class=\"status\">正在加载 6 件官方 OBJ…</p><div id=\"bicepsDynamicState\" class=\"plan\"><b>验收边界：</b>这是可观察的教学运动关系，不是关节面约束、真实力值、EMG 或 OpenSim 校准。</div><div id=\"anchorInvariant\" class=\"plan\" data-status=\"MEASURING\"><b>端点连续性仪表：</b>等待六件真实资产加载。</div><div class=\"gate\" id=\"bicepsVisualAudit\"><b>V0.7 视觉解剖审计：PUBLIC_VISUAL_GATE_FAILED。</b><br>真实 OBJ、视角变化和屈肘响应可见；但现有截图没有近端/远端肌肉锚点、端点距离不变量或新鲜页面版本证明，因此不能认证肌肉附着连续、关节面约束或碰撞安全。<a href=\"../docs/v0.1/evidence/m2/biceps-visual-anatomy-audit-v0.7.json\">审计证据</a>。</div></section><section class=\"card\"><h2>完整人体 / 解剖｜HUMAN-3D 能力块已验收</h2><p>完整 Human Atlas 保持在同一主入口：2,234 modeled pieces、3,432 FMA concepts、15 systems；可旋转、缩放、搜索、定位和按系统显示。M2 已按 Issue #2 独立通过公开 WebGL 验收。</p><iframe class=\"atlas\" title=\"完整人体解剖 Human Atlas\" src=\"anatomy/index.html\"></iframe><p class=\"status\">上游固定：ashemag/human-atlas；BodyParts3D 数据来源与许可信息保留在 anatomy/ATTRIBUTION.md。</p></section><section class=\"card\" id=\"m5-training-loop\"><div class=\"status\">M5｜COMPLETED｜2026-10-07｜训练反馈完整闭环</div><h2>训练闭环｜输入 → 解析 → 动作 → 解释 → 反馈 → 调整</h2><p id=\"m5EngineStatus\" class=\"status\">正在读取训练场景与安全分流规则…</p><div id=\"m5Parsed\" class=\"plan\">从页面顶部输入训练需求后，这里显示身体、目的、时间、环境、器械和限制的结构化解析。</div><div id=\"m5Actions\" class=\"m5-actions\"></div><div id=\"m5Session\" class=\"plan\">尚未生成训练会话。</div><div id=\"m5FeedbackPanel\" hidden><b>做完以后告诉我</b><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip feedback\" data-v=\"轻松\">轻松</button><button class=\"chip feedback\" data-v=\"合适\">合适</button><button class=\"chip feedback\" data-v=\"偏吃力\">偏吃力</button><button class=\"chip feedback\" data-v=\"疼痛或麻木\">疼痛/麻木</button></div></div><div id=\"feedbackResult\" class=\"plan\">等待完整训练会话。</div><p class=\"status\">安全边界：疼痛、麻木、眩晕、胸闷、胸痛、呼吸困难或受伤优先进入安全分流，不生成冒进训练建议。本原型提供训练组织与反馈调整，不替代医疗诊断。</p><div class=\"gate ok\"><b>M5 COMPLETED｜2026-10-07。</b><br>两份独立上传图片均在公开页面完成 MediaPipe 33/33 姿态推理；当前姿态实际桥接 OpenSim 最近状态，户外单杠与 15 分钟家中全身分别完成反馈调整，异常信号进入安全分流。<a href=\"../docs/v0.1/M5-completion-report-2026-10-07.md\">完成报告</a> · <a href=\"../docs/v0.1/evidence/m5/public-training-loop-verification.json\">公开验收证据</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/actions/runs/37606114771\">严格验收运行</a>。</div></section></main><script type=\"module\">try{const THREE=await import(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/+esm\");const{OrbitControls}=await import(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/examples/jsm/controls/OrbitControls.js/+esm\");const{OBJLoader}=await import(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/examples/jsm/loaders/OBJLoader.js/+esm\");const mount=document.getElementById(\"realUpper3d\"),state=document.getElementById(\"realAssetState\");const scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color(0xedf0ec);const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(35,mount.clientWidth/520,.01,100);const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true});renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));renderer.setSize(mount.clientWidth,520);mount.innerHTML=\"\";mount.appendChild(renderer.domElement);const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);controls.enableDamping=true;scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x5f685f,2.4));const key=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,2.7);key.position.set(4,6,5);scene.add(key);const defs=[[\"FJ3384\",\"右肩胛骨\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ3384.obj\",0xc8c0a9],[\"FJ3368\",\"右肱骨\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ3368.obj\",0xd7cfb8],[\"FJ3349\",\"右桡骨\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ3349.obj\",0xcfc7ae],[\"FJ3391\",\"右尺骨\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ3391.obj\",0xe1d9c2],[\"FJ1478\",\